        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "<b>Description from the acquisition register</b>\n\nParasol: the cover of printed silk, the stick of holly wood, hinged. Each of the eight compartments of the cover has a cornucopia of roses and other flowers, and a row of repeated floral sprigs form the border, all in bright colours. Ivory tips. The hinge is of brass stamped 'PATENT'."@en ;
